        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road construction, asphalt base layer, installation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road construction, asphalt base layer, installation
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: cee3d5f6-259f-4d7f-b4c4-7f604f915df1
This process represents the installation of one ton of asphalt base layer in road construction, including the laying and compaction activities.
Location: Europe
Technology: Generic process for different types of asphalt base layers and varying shares of recycled asphalt (RAP).
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cee3d5f6-259f-4d7f-b4c4-7f604f915df1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
